  unitName: Regal Sword Dolk
  unitId: 30684
  unitNumber: 1144
  description: A La Veda swordsman who surfaced about a decade before the appearance
    of the Ten-Winged Tormentor. Being the strongest Veda style fencing master, Dolk
    inherited the name of "Zelban." However, he soon found an incredibly talented
    pupil to whom he would pass this title, as he was more concerned about perfecting
    his craft, rather than serving as an instructor. Thus, his deeds left behind
    as "Zelban" are not many, though his skills reached outstanding new levels after
    he gave up his title.
  summonDesc: I am not Zelban.<br>I'm the man who was once Zelban.<br>If you're fine
    with that,<br>I shall lend you a hand.
  fusionDesc: Use whatever you require.<br>I know nothing of summoning, but I'll<br>accept
    it if it makes me stronger.
